#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:5
#: feb735663fa24c20934905dda41cd6a2
msgid "Reverse Thrust Setup"
msgstr "反推设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:7
#: de2cad8655e64980b245039a3a05c97c
msgid ""
"Some ESC's allow for reversing motor direction. When using reverse on the "
"propeller it will generate a negative thrust which can be used to reduce "
"your airspeed. During a steep landing approach this method can be used to "
"maintain a stable and low airspeed allowing you to land much more softly and"
" precisely. Reverse thrust can also be automatically used during automatic "
"landings (see below) or during other throttle controlled modes to steepen "
"descents. See  :ref:`Reverse Thrust Setup<reverse-thrust-setup>` for details"
" on setting up reverse thrust."
msgstr ""
"部分 ESC "
"允许反转电机方向。对螺旋桨使用反转时，会产生负推力，可用于降低空速。在陡坡进近降落时，此方法可用于维持稳定的低速飞行，使降落更加柔和精确。反推力也可在自动降落（见下文）或其他油门控制模式下自动使用，以加速下降。有关反推力设置的详细信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`反推力设置<reverse-thrust-setup>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:10
#: 35f347918d86465c958fbf1b4d65d533
msgid ""
"enabling reverse thrust automatically sets the SERVOx_TRIM value to LOW "
"throttle stick for the throttle output servo. SERVOx_TRIM is normally "
"ignored, and low stick is SERVOx_MIN! Arming in this condition with an ESC "
"not properly setup will spin-up the motor, possibly dramatically!"
msgstr ""
"启用反推力会自动将油门输出舵机的 SERVOx_TRIM 值设为低油门杆位置。SERVOx_TRIM 通常被忽略，低杆位对应 SERVOx_MIN！在 "
"ESC 未正确设置的情况下，在此状态下解锁可能会使电机急速运转，甚至非常剧烈！"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:13
#: 992d2663c7cd42eea5eb452ed1e19256
msgid "Reverse-Thrust in AutoLanding and Throttle Controlled Modes"
msgstr "自动降落和油门控制模式下的反推力"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:15
#: 43b9b0589f8846cc830573298a258ed6
msgid ""
"To use this feature in automatic landings, it is highly recommend to use an "
"airspeed sensor and a rangefinder (see above) for an accurate altitude."
msgstr "在自动降落中使用此功能，强烈建议使用空速传感器和测距仪（见上文）以获取精确高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:17
#: e6dfc2c40f3241adb021811116bf4b7d
msgid ""
"The below video is an example of a Skywalker X8 performing an auto-landing "
"with a 15 degree slope. The target is the hat on the ground showing it is "
"possible to get repeatable high precision landings where the final position "
"error was dictated by the GPS position error. This particular aircraft has "
"been landed at 20deg and 25deg slopes too. You may have different results "
"depending on weight of aircraft and available thrust from motor/propeller. "
"Typically a Skywalker X8 would need a shallow slope such at 6 to 10deg."
msgstr ""
"以下视频是 Skywalker X8 以 15 度坡度执行自动降落的示例。目标是地面上的帽子，展示了可重复的高精度降落，最终位置误差由 GPS "
"定位误差决定。该飞机也曾以 20 度和 25 度坡度降落。根据飞机重量和电机/螺旋桨的可用推力，您的结果可能有所不同。通常 Skywalker X8 "
"需要 6 到 10 度的浅坡度。"

