msgid "``SERVOx_TRIM`` where x is the throttle output channel"
msgstr "``SERVOx_TRIM``，其中 x 为油门输出通道"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:35
#: 80a19fc58671405c8f13897b0e79d6c7
msgid ":ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>`"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:37
#: 33eb2650a4444878834816612a4c22a2
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The maximum amount of reverse thrust used in autopilot throttle controlled "
"modes is set by :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>`. A value of -100 provides the "
"maximum, while -20 would provide 20% of  maximum, and so on."
msgstr ""
"在飞控油门控制模式下使用的最大反推力量由 :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>` 设定。值为 -100 提供最大反推力，-20 "
"则提供最大反推力的 20%，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:39
#: bfbf2337e68640a2bac9c105302fcf03
msgid ""
"The :ref:`USE_REV_THRUST <USE_REV_THRUST>` parameter is a bit mask that "
"allows the setting of when reverse thrust can be activated, as when "
"autolanding, or in other throttle controlled modes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`USE_REV_THRUST <USE_REV_THRUST>` "
"参数是位掩码，用于设置何时可以激活反推力，例如自动降落时或其他油门控制模式下。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:41
#: 5240e8de251c4c098610aa806951ba84
msgid ""
"Reverse thrust is enabled in MANUAL mode independent of "
":ref:`USE_REV_THRUST<USE_REV_THRUST>` parameter if :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` "
"is < 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:43
#: 27923008981f42eda25b10848a078db5
msgid ""
"If an RC channel's ``RCx_OPTION`` auxiliary function has been set to \"64\","
" then activating the switch will also provide access to the reverse thrust "
"capability in non-throttle controlled modes, as shown in the :ref:`Reverse "
"Thrust Setup<reverse-thrust-setup>` section."
msgstr ""
"若某 RC 通道的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 辅助功能已设置为 「64」，则激活该开关还可在非油门控制模式下使用反推力功能，如 "
":ref:`反推力设置<reverse-thrust-setup>` 章节所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:45
#: 6a3c0e41c1094e7c9ab3e67666f2708b
msgid ""
"Airbrakes can also be automatically deployed during reverse thrust "
"operation. See :ref:`Airbrakes<airbrakes-on-plane>`."
msgstr "气动刹车也可在反推力操作期间自动展开。参见 :ref:`气动刹车<airbrakes-on-plane>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:49
#: 24a219e7bc8240c1aaf5bf05fc9a88b0
msgid "ESC (Electronic Speed Controller)"
msgstr "ESC（电子调速器）"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:51
#: 875a02cb61544bc987bf9132343ea285
msgid ""
"Most important is to set the :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>` (assuming the "
"esc/motor is attached to output 3) to the point that the ESC is idle, "
"usually around mid-range (1500us) to create an output curve that has "
":ref:`SERVO3_MAX<SERVO3_MAX>` for full forward thrust, and "
":ref:`SERVO3_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>` for full reverse thrust. This should be done "
"AFTER the RC Calibrations setup step."
msgstr ""
"最重要的是将 :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>` （假设 ESC/电机连接到输出 3）设置到 ESC "
"空转时的位置，通常约为中间范围（1500us），从而创建以 :ref:`SERVO3_MAX<SERVO3_MAX>` "
"为全前推力、:ref:`SERVO3_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>` 为全反推力的输出曲线。此操作应在 RC 校准设置步骤之后进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:54
#: 3cdcd01731444acda365a1291dcafa3e
msgid "Hardware selection and programming"
msgstr "硬件选型与编程"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:56
#: cb3f6ec828c74cb499241001b60b03e6
msgid ""
"Many ESCs can operate in forwards and reverse, however that is usually not a"
" stock feature and may need to be reprogrammed to do it. Any SimonK and "
"BLHeli compatible ESC can be flashed to support reverse thrust."
msgstr ""
"许多 ESC 可以正反转操作，但通常不是出厂功能，可能需要重新编程。任何兼容 SimonK 和 BLHeli 的 ESC 均可刷写固件以支持反推力。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:58
#: 4e529cc77e414ac784b3305f3311278b
msgid ""
"`Here's info about BLHeli compatible ones "
"<https://blhelisuite.wordpress.com/>`__."
msgstr "`关于 BLHeli 兼容 ESC 的信息 <https://blhelisuite.wordpress.com/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:62
#: 6747aed22f40446182d1aa71e97bdfd3
msgid "Hardware configuration"
msgstr "硬件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:66
#: 93e999b95f9f48e7ab245e4b46bb3d09
msgid "Remove propeller while configuring ESCs and thrust parameters"
msgstr "在配置 ESC 和推力参数时请取下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:68
#: 81c3e08ffa0a4a97bcfb55fba3088755
msgid ""
"Configure your ESC for reverse thrust by changing its neutral point. Many "
"ESC require custom firmware to accomplish this. Search Google or your ESC "
"manufacturer for instructions on how to configure your particular ESC."
msgstr ""
"通过更改中性点来配置您的 ESC 以支持反推力。许多 ESC 需要自定义固件才能实现此功能。请搜索 Google 或咨询 ESC 制造商以获取特定 "
"ESC 的配置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/reverse-thrust-autolanding.rst:71
#: 6ea15f0efcab4440bc824beb5f0c04ad
msgid ""
"Set  Minimum PWM to 1000, mid to 1500, and maximum to 2000, corresponding to"
" maximum reverse thrust,idle, and maximum positive thrust from the "
"ESC/Motor."
msgstr "将最小 PWM 设为 1000，中间值设为 1500，最大值设为 2000，对应 ESC/电机的最大反推力、空转和最大正推力。"
